Package: bfcli
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: 0ct0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libasound2t64 | libasound2, libpulse0
Homepage: https://github.com/0ct0sec/GNDHOG
Description: Betaflight and Meshtastic terminal for Cardputer Zero
 GNDHOG ZERO provides Betaflight field checks, CLI command history,
 completion, and configuration backup and restore over USB or UART.
 A separate Meshtastic radio enables chat and local transcripts; an optional
 GNSS receiver adds position sharing, range, bearing, and saved marks.
